{"status":"success","message":null,"data":{"responsibilities":null,"overview":null,"locations":"Bangalore/Hyderabad","processCompleted":false,"deleted":false,"mailPublished":true,"newCompany":false,"dream":false,"notificationMuted":true,"applied":false,"studentOopsOrFrozen":false,"modifyAllowed":false,"withdrawAllowed":false,"withdrawalDeadlineSameAsApplicationDeadline":false,"displayNameSameAsCompanyName":true,"includedInApplicationMatrix":false,"application_detail_id":4086,"application_id":657,"application_status_id":3,"placement_process_id":44,"batch_group_id":0,"batch_group_ids":"[59, 60]","dayslot_id":0,"cluster_id":0,"cluster_sequence_number":0,"job_function_id":0,"uuid":"a7515d76-0673-4083-a37b-bc66b1c8d966","sector_id":20,"company_id":679,"max_roles_to_be_applied":null,"company_name":"Collins Aerospace","job_title":"Post Graduate Engineer Trainee","sector_label":"Aerospace and Defense","other_sector":"","max_roles":0,"job_summary":"","job_function":"","job_description":"","process_name":"FT 2025-26","batch_group_label":"","skills":"•\tPython (Pandas, Numpy, Matplotlib, Seaborn, Scikit learn, Tensorflow)\n•\tWell versed with PHM (Prognostic Health Monitoring) concepts of feature engineering, anomaly detection, model performance metrics, signal processing, statistical analysis\n•\tKnowledge on Physics based analytics & physics informed Machine Learning approaches\n•\tSolid foundation in machine learning algorithms (regression, classification, anomaly detection, time-series forecasting).\n","website_url":"www.collinsaerospace.com","eligibility_information":"7.0 with no backlogs and only Indian national only","job_package":"","min_work_experience":0,"max_work_experience":0,"is_dream":false,"date_of_visit":null,"publish_time":1762769953000,"withdrawl_deadline":1764145800000,"application_deadline":1764145800000,"application_start_time":1764057107000,"additional_information":"Skill sets: &#10;<div>&#8226;&#9;Python (Pandas, Numpy, Matplotlib, Seaborn, Scikit learn, Tensorflow)&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Well versed with PHM (Prognostic Health Monitoring) concepts of feature engineering, anomaly detection, model performance metrics, signal processing, statistical analysis&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Knowledge on Physics based analytics &amp; physics informed Machine Learning approaches&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Solid foundation in machine learning algorithms (regression, classification, anomaly detection, time-series forecasting).&#10;</div><div>Job Description:&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Develop physics based analytics &amp; physics informed machine learning&#8211;based analytics for sensory data from aircraft systems (e.g., engines, actuators, fuel and air conditioning systems).&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Work closely with SMEs, design engineers, and PHM teams to understand the physical behavior of systems and translate it into analytical models.&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Analyze and process large-scale time-series data using Databricks, PySpark, and distributed computing frameworks.&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Develop fault detection, degradation tracking, and anomaly detection algorithms using statistical and ML methods.&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Integrate physics-based features (derived from thermodynamics, fluid mechanics, or system modeling) with ML models for improved interpretability and accuracy.&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Perform feature engineering, dimensionality reduction, and signal fusion across multiple sensors and systems.&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Validate and verify analytics using test data and SME feedback, ensuring physical consistency and robustness.&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Collaborate in the development of digital twins, prognostics and health management (PHM) models, and predictive maintenance frameworks.&#10;</div><div>Other Preferred skill sets that are nice to have:&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Experience developing physics-informed neural networks (PINNs) or hybrid physics + ML models.&#10;</div><div>&#822